	(text_box "Power hub v0.4 — 24 V in (JST VH) → reverse protection + TVS → 4 × TPS26600 eFuse (1.6 A) → 6-pin JST PH rows A–D.\nRack controller: ESP32-S3-MINI-1, TCAN1044AV (CAN master, star bus, both terminations here), POS token per row.\nEvery row is on without firmware: a 1M/150k divider from 24 V holds SHDN high; the controller's NFET pulls it low."
